# Keep the build context to what the image actually runs.
#
# This is not only about image size. `.env` holds the service role key, and a
# COPY that swept it into a layer would put a secret inside every copy of the
# image, where deleting it later does not help — the layer keeps it.
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
tests/
requirements-dev.txt
pytest.ini
*.md
*.html
.git/
.venv/
venv/
